From 0638fbe4ec4c8c55942faa522f61284066edbb0e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ReArc Overlay <overlay@rearc.invalid>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 10:33:02 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] P-TAB-001 wave 18d: query and delete profile history through
 HistoryService

Add bounded recent/text history queries and URL/range removal with deferred callbacks, profile cancellation and explicit OTR rejection. ABI 1.23 / bridge 0.25.0; build p65 and native history isolation, exact range boundaries and cancellation pass.

Last rebased: 2026-11-04 onto Chromium 156.0.8078.74 (d331de35ca).

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
